    "description": "Rajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSSB) has released the Answer Key on its official website for the recruitment of RSSB Computer Instructor posts . The exam was conducted on 22 – 23 August 2026. and the last date to submit the application form was 23 June 2026. Candidates can also check their Answer Key by using their Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below. ( Advt. No. : 07/2026 )",
