    "description": "Institute of Banking Personnel Selection (IBPS) , has released a Notification on its official website for the Group “A” Officers (Scale-I, II & III) and Group “B” Office Assistants (Multipurpose) Examination Posts. This recruitment is for 13,706 positions. The IBPS application form has started on 01 September 2026, and candidates can apply until 21 September 2026. The minimum age is 18 - 21 Years & the maximum age is 28 - 40 years Post Wise as on 01 September 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for the IBPS RRB 15th Recruitment 2026 provided below.",
