    "description": "Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission (UPSSSC) , has released the Admit Card on its official website for the recruitment of Excise Constable Posts. The exam will be conducted on 20 September 2026. and the last date to submit the application form was 24 June 2026. Candidates can also check their Admit Card by using their Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below. ( Advt. No. 08 Exam 2026 )",
