    "description": "Union Public Service Commission UPSC , has released the Answer Key on its official website for the Recruitment of Examination of National Defence Academy & Naval Academy II 2026. The exam was conducted on 13 September 2026. and the last date to submit the application form was 11 June 2026. Candidates can also check their Answer Key by using their Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below. ( Advt. No. 10/2026-NDA-II )",
    "seoKeywords": "",
