    "shortInfo": "Union Public Service Commission UPSC , has released the IFS Mains Exam Date on its official website for the Recruitment of Civil Services and Forest Service IAS / IFS Examination 2026 . The IFS exam will conducted on 22 to 29 November 2026 . UPSC Application Mains Form has started on 13 July 2026 & the candidates can apply Until 22 July 2026. Minimum age required is 21 Years & The Maximum Age Is 32 Years as on 01 August 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for UPSC Civil Services IFS Mains Exam Date 2026 which has given below. ( Advt. No. 05/2026 )",
