    "description": "Staff Selection Commission (SSC Delhi Police) , has released the PHYSICAL ENDURANCE AND MEASUREMENT TEST (PE&MT) Admit Card on its official website for the Recruitment of Delhi Police HC (Ministerial) Examination 2026. The Physical Exam will be conducted on 28 - 29 September 2026 , The SSC application process started on 29 September 2025 , and candidates were able to submit their applications until 20 October 2025 . Candidates can download their PE & MT Admit Card using their Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.",
